      "message": "docs(research): HEIDENHAIN control dialects by NC software version\n\nResearch notes for the HEIDENHAIN posts: the dialect of each TNC\ncontrol and NC software version, a cycle name table, a proposal for\ncapability flags and profiles, the manual inventory (IDs and URLs,\nno manuals), and the Picomax 55 review of both posts.\n\nRefs #4095\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
